{"id":"cita","lemma":"cita","pos":"noun","rank":512,"glosses":["date (romantic outing)","appointment","quote, quotation"],"ipa":"/ˈθita/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"citas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-cita.wav","formAudio":{"citas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/98/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-citas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tengo una cita.","en":"I have a date.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440244","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ella le pidió una cita.","en":"She asked him out on a date.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599094","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to ask for something","l":"pedir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"¿Tienes cita con él?","en":"Do you have an appointment with him?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534428","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"he"}]},{"text":"Las citas pueden ser muy estresantes.","en":"Dating can be very stressful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582472","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"stressful","l":"estresante"}]},{"text":"Es una cita del libro.","en":"It's a quote from the book.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/552858","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"book"}]}]}